        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Starting at only <strong>$2,699.</strong></p><p><strong>A Road Bike. A Training Partner. Built for Triathletes.</strong></p><p>The Rogue is a perfected blend of aerodynamics and endurance. It is the only bike you need for twisted tarmac, long escapes, and hard interval training. Trusted by both triathletes and roadies, the Rogue was built to break records. </p><h5></h5>",
